--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project builds a container image that includes, but does not modify or
statically link against, the following:

ComfyUI — https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI
    GPL-3.0-or-later. Run as a separate process over a loopback HTTP API; this
    worker links against none of its code.

FLUX.2 klein 4B model weights — https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs
    Apache-2.0. Includes the fp8, bf16 and NVFP4 distributions of both the
    distilled and base 4B models.

Qwen3-4B text encoder, FLUX.2 VAE
    Apache-2.0. Repackaged for ComfyUI by Comfy-Org.

PyTorch, Pillow, pydantic, urllib3, huggingface_hub, runpod
    See each project for its own licence.

FLUX.2-dev and the FLUX.2 klein 9B family are NOT included. They are released
under the FLUX Non-Commercial License and are deliberately outside the scope of
this project.
